title: Welcome & Approach Detection Lighting
raw_community_title: 'Welcome lights (approach detection)


  ** WARNING ** enabling this some have commented that the keyless touch entry is
  less sensitive to locking/unlocking the door'
category: General
platform: Ranger (6G)
model_years: 2024+
trim: All
source_sheet: (2024+) 6G Ranger.xlsx
notes: 'Trim: All? [Confirmed: craigc (9/11/2024) Lariat FX4]'
steps:
- module: BCM
  address: 726-45-01
  notes: '* -> 0=Disabled, 1=Enabled

    FORScan Menu: unknown, use asbuilt (advanced)

    Trim: All? [Confirmed: craigc (9/11/2024) Lariat FX4]'
  targets:
  - mask: xxxx xxxx x*--
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 0
      action: 1
      feature_name: Approach_Lighting_Enable_Cfg (ALEC)
      target_state: ALEC ENABLE
- module: BCM
  address: 726-18-01
  notes: '* -> 0=Disabled, 1=Enabled

    FORScan Menu: unknown, use asbuilt (advanced)'
  targets:
  - mask: xxxx xxxx x*--
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 0
      action: 1
      feature_name: Feat_Cfg [APPROACHDETECTION] [VEHICLE] (APPROACHDETECTION_VEHICLE)
      target_state: APPROACHDETECTION_VEHICLE ENABLE
- module: APIM
  address: 7D0-09-01
  notes: 'suggest using non asbuilt to change this

    * Bit 3 (add 4 to value to enable, e.g. change 3 to 7)

    FORScan Menu: Approach Detection Control Function (Disabled to Enabled, plus it''s
    required to also make the BdyCm Changes above)'
  targets:
  - mask: xxx* xxxx xx--
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 2
      action: 1
      feature_name: Approach Detection Control Function (ADCF)
      target_state: ADCF Enabled
recipe_version: '1.1'
